text=text.replace('Final exact-pair receipts and installer links are recorded below when sealed. This is scoped development qualification, not publication readiness.',f'''## Qualified delivery

Final script SHA-256: `{qualification['script_sha256']}`. [Qualification and receipt hashes](QUALIFICATION_0853.json) and [archive contents/artifact identities](PACKAGE_0853.json) pin the exact delivery; source and loaded native identities were verified. Native compilation/tests passed **39/39 suites**; **167 Python tests passed**; generation accounts for **296 semantic controls**.

The final Max 2027 script passed all eight presets through Load, one Undo/Redo and exact full-row/Paint save/reopen (72 lifecycle phases). The painted existing-mountain test preserved all existing authored settings except the derived viewport-budget share, exact placement rows and Paint. Ready Save/Load excluded a duplicate-name unrelated model, retained evaluated Noise terrain/Paint and did no placement work. Renamed ready presets load; Redo works without the original package directory. Capacity, cancellation, late staged failure and closing after Add release their state correctly.

The copied final EXE installed into an owned profile; installed Paint/channel presets passed load/Undo/reopen at configured 150%. Missing channel 2 chose included terrain; compatible channel 2 reused current terrain. After delayed notifications, Manual remained current. Live performed **one solve**. Final pointer Load retained preceding full rows and also performed one solve. The exact final MZP wrapper completed in that isolated profile.

Live idle for **{qualification['idle_seconds']:.3f} seconds**, browsing, selection, rollout toggles and unrelated time changes produced zero solve/preparation/receiver-read/upload counter changes. The preceding same-campaign UI stage measured **48 settled page/owner layouts** at default/150%, with zero clipped/overlapping controls; library bounds passed at 1000×680 and 850×620. Native/C#/main-panel code was unchanged by the final loader timing fix. Final installed Load and Save at 150% were also visually inspected. Actual wheel/drag navigation was observed in the default Modify column and retained placement data. These are scoped tests, not physical 4K/mixed-monitor or FPS qualification.

Installers: [Max 2027 MZP](../../../dist/CyrusScatter-0.85.3-20261016/CyrusScatter-0.85.3-Max2027.mzp), [unsigned Windows EXE](../../../dist/CyrusScatter-0.85.3-20261016/CyrusScatter-0.85.3-Max2027-Setup.exe). Both include the same plugin pair and eight ready presets. Run the MZP through **Scripting > Run Script**, then restart Max 2027. The artist profile was not installed into or restarted. Git is not pushed by this task; binaries/scenes/installers remain ignored local artifacts. Website sources/builds are separate from publication.

The receipts preserve notification, path and fixture failures as predecessors; they do not qualify those failed iterations. Early UI measurements made before Max/Qt layout settled are not final clipping evidence. Further Phase 6/I07 work stays paused. This is development qualification for the declared adapter, not publication readiness.''')
path.write_text(text,encoding='utf-8')
site=ROOT/'website';chapters=json.loads((site/'content/guide-chapters.json').read_text())
